coverage
.dev-mail
# `.pgdata`, with the dot. It was written `pgdata` and Docker matched
# nothing: the pattern is compared against path components literally, so a
# 61 MB local Postgres was being uploaded to the remote builder on every
# `fly deploy`. Not a secret — a seeded dev database — but pointless, slow,
# and the kind of near-miss worth naming: `.vercelignore` had it right and
# this file did not.
.pgdata
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Build output from a local `vercel build`; nothing the image needs.
.vercel
sink.jsonl
